            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo memorizzare <code>True</code> in una variabile proprio come una stringa o un numero. Anche visualizzarlo funziona allo stesso modo, come quando visualizziamo qui <code>correct</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"correct = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(correct)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>correct</code>.</p></body></html>",
