            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo salvare <code>False</code> nella variabile <code>status</code> e visualizzare <code>status</code> nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Load data&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"status = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(status)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Load data\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>False</code>, seguito da <code>status</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo salvare <code>False</code> in una variabile e poi visualizzare la variabile nella console.</p><p>Salva il valore speciale <code>False</code> in <code>status</code>, poi stampa <code>status</code> per mostrarlo nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Load data&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"status = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(status)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;False&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Load data\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>False</code>, seguito da <code>status</code>.</p></body></html>",
