                "id": "00e4efc4-5c4c-4408-9bc8-aefeee153c63"
              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"00e4efc4-5c4c-4408-9bc8-aefeee153c63\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p>Il codice <code>not</code> davanti a <code>True</code> fa sì che il risultato dell'espressione sia <code>False</code>. Se qualcosa non è vero, deve essere falso.</p><p><code>not</code> è l'<strong>operatore di negazione</strong>. Trasforma i valori nel loro <strong>opposto</strong>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "The not operator",
            "id": 76367,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando cambiamo un valore nel suo opposto con <code>not</code>, lo neghiamo, come qui con <code>not True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"not\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>not</code>, seguito da <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando cambiamo un valore nel suo opposto con <code>not</code>, lo neghiamo.</p><p>Nega il valore speciale <code>True</code> in modo che il codice stampi <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"not\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>not</code>, seguito da <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "The not operator",
            "id": 76366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'operatore <code>not</code> prima di <code>False</code> ne cambia il valore. Se un valore non è <code>False</code>, deve essere <code>True</code>. Possiamo verificarlo visualizzando <code>not False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"not\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>not</code>, seguito da <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'operatore <code>not</code> inverte un valore speciale. Se un valore non è <code>False</code>, deve essere <code>True</code>.</p><p>Nega <code>False</code> in modo che il codice stampi <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"not\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>not</code>, seguito da <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
